unit test_shir_call_bloom

ShirBody sum
  params : [(_0 "nums": i32[], Guaranteed)]
  locals : []
  block  :
    Return(adopt Cast(adopt Call(Builtin(LocalRef(_0), "len"), []), i32))

ShirBody forward
